<div class="page-title-row" style="margin-bottom:24px"><div><h1>Integrations</h1><p>Configure your receiving UPI account and an opt-in receipt mailbox.</p></div></div><?php if(!empty($notice)):?><div class="note panel"><?=h($notice)?></div><?php endif?><div class="callout callout-info">Use a dedicated email inbox with only the access needed for payment receipts. The app password grants mailbox access, not just receipt access. It is encrypted at rest, but it remains a sensitive credential. Revoke it when no longer required; review applicable privacy and provider terms.</div><div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>UPI account & receipt mailbox</h3><span class="badge <?=($account['is_active']??false)?'badge-success':'badge-pending'?>"><?=($account['is_active']??false)?'Connected':'Not configured'?></span></div><form method="post" class="form-grid"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf_token())?>"><div class="field"><label>Account label</label><input name="account_label" value="<?=h($account['account_label']??'Primary UPI')?>" required></div><div class="field"><label>UPI ID</label><input name="upi_id" value="<?=h($account['upi_id']??'')?>" placeholder="name@bank" required></div><div class="field"><label>Receipt email address</label><input type="email" name="linked_email" value="<?=h($account['linked_email']??'')?>" required></div><div class="field"><label>IMAP host</label><input name="imap_host" value="<?=h($account['imap_host']??'imap.gmail.com')?>" placeholder="imap.gmail.com" required></div>
<div class="field"><label>IMAP port (SSL/TLS)</label><input type="number" min="1" max="65535" name="imap_port" value="<?=h((string)($account['imap_port']??993))?>" required></div>
<div class="field"><label>Google app password <?=!empty($account)?'(leave blank to keep current)':''?></label><input type="password" name="app_password" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9 ]{16,20}" autocomplete="new-password" <?=empty($account)?'required':''?> placeholder="16 characters"></div><div class="field full"><button class="btn btn-primary">Save integration</button></div></form><?php if($account):?><p style="font-size:10px;color:#758299">Last parser check: <?=h($account['last_checked_at']?:'Not checked yet')?></p><?php if(!empty($account['last_error'])):?><p style="font-size:10px;color:#963d3d">Last error: <?=h($account['last_error'])?></p><?php endif?><?php endif?></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>Test this connection</h3><span class="badge badge-blue">Diagnostic</span></div><p style="font-size:11px;color:#6d7a90;line-height:1.8;margin-top:0">Saves nothing. Opens the mailbox read-only and reports whether the address, host and app password work together. Run it after saving, then check that a real receipt from your provider is recognised.</p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="test"><button class="btn btn-secondary">Test mailbox connection</button></form><?php if($test):?><div class="callout callout-info" style="margin-top:14px;<?=$test['ok']?'':'border-color:#f3d2d2;background:#fff7f6;color:#963d3d'?>"><?=h($test['message'])?></div><?php endif?></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-title"><h3>How to create a Google app password</h3><button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('app-guide').hidden=!document.getElementById('app-guide').hidden">View instructions</button></div><div id="app-guide" hidden><ol style="font-size:11px;line-height:2;color:#5f6c81"><li>Enable two-step verification on the dedicated mailbox account.</li><li>Visit the Google Account security settings and find App passwords (availability may vary by account).</li><li>Create a password for this deployment and copy it once into the encrypted field above.</li><li>Enable IMAP for that mailbox, configure the cron privately, test with a receipt sample, and revoke the app password if you disconnect.</li></ol><div class="callout callout-info">Never paste this password into chat, logs, source control or browser code. Receipt parsing is provider-format-specific and should be tested against non-sensitive samples.</div></div></div><?php require __DIR__.'/includes/dashboard-footer.php';?>